flowchart TD
    A[Raw source row] --> B[Normalize identifiers and preserve raw values]
    B --> C{Exact canonical SKU?}
    C -- Yes --> D[A / 100 product match]
    C -- No --> E{Approved SKU alias?}
    E -- Yes --> F[A / 95 product match]
    E -- No --> G{Unique ASIN in marketplace/account/date scope?}
    G -- Yes --> H[B / 85 provisional product match]
    G -- No --> I{Approved brand evidence?}
    I -- Yes --> J[C / 60 brand-only match]
    I -- No --> K[F / 0 unresolved]
    D --> L[Assign product_key and brand_key]
    F --> L
    H --> M[Review queue and materiality gate]
    M --> L
    J --> N[Exception mart; no product_key]
    K --> O[Quarantine with owner and SLA]
    L --> P[Finance facts and marts]
    L --> Q[Identity coverage dashboard]
    N --> Q
    O --> Q

